<title>CHINA: M.LYNCH SETS CHEUNG KONG, CKI WARRANTS.</title>
<headline>M.LYNCH SETS CHEUNG KONG, CKI WARRANTS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Tuesday it had issued 2.3 billion American-style basket call warrants on Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd and Cheung Kong Infrastructure Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd			0.04 shrs</p>
<p> Cheung Kong Infrastructure Holdings Ltd   0.05 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$5.0575	PREMIUM	 15.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.08	  GEARING	 6.33x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   01.JUN.98	PAYDATE	 02.SEPT.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  03.SEPT.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$5.0575	EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
